 "remarks": "2026 total renovation throughout. 1st and 2nd Floor Apts with New Kitchen, New Appliances: Gas Range Micro Hood and Fridge. New Hardwood Floors, New interior Paint throughout, New Full Bathroom with Tub Shower and Glass sliding doors, New Toilet , New Vanity, includes New A/C window units each, Thermopane windows refurbished. Front Door opens to this Main level 1st floor unit directly into open Living Room-Dining Room combo, 2 bedrooms have Newly finished hardwood floors, closets. There are new built-in shelves next to closet in primary bedroom. The Apts also offer One bay of the 2 car garage and parking space for an additional car on newly paved driveway. Owner is offering 1 free month on a 13 month amortized lease. Owner will consider a 2 year lease with 2 months free. Pets are welcome with an additional $500 security deposit. Only compact, small, well mannered pets allowed under 25lbs. With owner responsible for pet refuse on lawn. Brand New Washer/Dryer for each unit in basement and New Carpet Runner in front and rear stairwells installed this Month. Storage in walk up attic for upper unit and storage in basement for lower unit. Front and back stairwells for easy access. Both units have covered front porch. Garbage Bins are provided (Stamford Town picks curb-up weekly each Wed). Wonderfully located within walking distance to Synagogue, easy office commutes, Glenbrook Train station, shopping, recreation, restaurants, gyms, beach all within a few mile drive",
